    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404">

                <pb facs="0608" n="08 [508]" xml:id="pg508"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6212/25</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Administrator of
                        the National Recovery Administration</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-01-12">January 12, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose for your information and any
                    action deemed appropriate a circular<anchor n="40" xml:id="d404-f1"/> of the
                    American League for the Defense of Jewish Rights, 729 Seventh Avenue, New York
                    City, bearing the emblem of the National Recovery Administration and advocating
                    a boycott of German goods.</p>
                <p>The enclosed circular was brought to the attention of this Department by the
                    Germany Embassy in Washington, at the instance of the German Government, and
                    representations were made regarding the use of the “Blue Eagle” thereon.</p>
                <p>I shall appreciate advices as to any action that may be taken regarding this
                    matter.</p>
                <p>The German Embassy requests the return of the enclosed circular for its
                        files.<anchor n="41" xml:id="d404-f2"/></p>
                <p>Very truly yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d404-f1" n="40" xml:id="d404-f1-content">
                <p>Not reprinted.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d404-f2" n="41" xml:id="d404-f2-content">
                <p>No reply to this representation by the German Embassy has been found in
                    Department files.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
